<Base title="Privacy" description="How the BORGAS website handles browsing and inquiry information."><section class="section"><div class="wrap reading"><p class="eyebrow">Website information</p><h1>Privacy.</h1><p>Updated September 13, 2026.</p><h2>Browsing this website</h2><p>BORGAS does not add analytics, advertising trackers, account registration or tracking cookies to this website. Fonts and product images are served with the site.</p><p>The public website is hosted on GitHub Pages. Hosting and network providers may process technical request information, such as IP addresses, to deliver and protect the site. Their own privacy policies apply to their services.</p><h2>Product inquiries</h2><p>Where an email contact option is available, information you enter stays in the page until you choose to open an email draft. The site does not store the form contents or submit them to a server. Your email application and email provider handle the message when you send it.</p><p>BORGAS uses information you send to respond to your question and handle related support. Please include only the information needed for your request. An inquiry does not sign you up for marketing.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Software release links open GitHub. External services have their own privacy practices. Review them before sharing information or downloading files.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Use the contact options shown on the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> for questions about your information.</p></div></section></Base>
